<div class="programme">
  <h2><a href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsProgramme_13939138">Tenzing</a> (PG)</h2>
  <div class="fivecol">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/PHL/13992254.jpg"/>
    </div>
	<div class="synopsis"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; &#8211; Little White Lies. This gripping biographical drama is packed with sheer adventure and dizzying stakes, following the story of one of the most important mountain climbers in history.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Based on true events, and taking inspiration from Ed Douglas&#8217; book, </span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Tenzing</span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;tells the story of one of the most important mountain climbers in history. 1953. Sherpa Tenzing Norway (Genden Phuntsok) and Sir Edmund Hillary (Tom Hiddleston) venture to be the first in history to summit Mount Everest, or Chomolungma as Norgay knows it. This gripping biographical drama is packed with sheer adventure and dizzying stakes but the heart of the story is the emotional and spiritual journey of Norway, whose striking courage and ardent ambition leads him to overcome incredible odds.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
</div>
  </div>
  <div class="sevencol last timesandsynopsis">
    <h3 class="blockheading blockheading--small blockheading--light blockheading--arrow text--left">
    Buy Tickets
    </h3>
