<div class="programme">
  <h2><a href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsProgramme_14041653">Hellraiser</a> (18)</h2>
  <div class="fivecol">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/PHL/14041651.jpg"/>
    </div>
	<div class="synopsis"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">"&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; &#8211; Utterly bizarre and entirely ridiculous &#8211; and yet effective" &#8211; Guardian. When degenerate hedonist Frank seeks new demonic pleasures within an occult puzzle box, he opens a portal to the hellish Cenobite dimension where extreme pain is the ultimate ecstasy!</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Gory psycho-sexual horror god Clive Barker is an out-and-proud hero of the genre. Born from his own experiences in queer BDSM clubs and subculture, Barker conjured up a visceral body horror vision of bondage, leather and body-modification.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">When degenerate hedonist Frank seeks new demonic pleasures within an occult puzzle box, he opens a portal to the hellish Cenobite dimension where extreme pain is the ultimate ecstasy. An unadulterated queer horror celebration of transgressive desire, forbidden pleasure, and sadomasochistic self-actualisation.</span></p>
</div>
  </div>
