  <h2><a href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsProgramme_13819336">Ghosts: The Possession of Button House</a> (PG)</h2>
  <div class="fivecol">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/PHL/13819329.jpg"/>
    </div>
	<div class="synopsis"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">They&#8217;re not back, they never left! The action returns to the crumbling mansion where Britain's favourite ragtag bunch of ghosts live.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">They&#8217;re not back, they never left! Britain&#8217;s favourite spooks and spectres make the leap to the big screen in this feature from the acclaimed team behind the BBC smash hit comedy. The action returns to the crumbling mansion where young couple Alison and Mike (Charlotte Richie and Kiell Smith-Bynoe) first encountered the ragtag bunch of ghosts, as the cast and writers reunite for a spooky new story this Halloween.</span></p>
</div>
  </div>
