    </h3>
    <div class="filmtimes"><table cellpadding="0"><tr valign="top"><td><table cellpadding="0"><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Saturday 24 Oct 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">11:30am <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13689899.TcsSection_4078727">Book Now</a><span class="PerformanceNotesSmall"> (Relaxed Environment)</span></span></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div>
