v 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">8:15pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945452.TcsSection_4075334">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Thursday 5 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">1:00pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_14058590.TcsSection_4075334">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Thursday 5 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">6:00pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945454.TcsSection_4075334">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Thursday 5 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">8:45pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945456.TcsSection_4078727">Book Now</a><span class="PerformanceNotesSmall"> (Descriptive subtitles)</span></span></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div>
