<div class="programme">
  <h2><a href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsProgramme_13945480">Ken Russell’s The Devils - 4K Restoration</a> (18)</h2>
  <div class="fivecol">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/PHL/14042153.jpg"/>
    </div>
	<div class="synopsis"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Censored for more than half a century, Ken Russell&#8217;s visionary masterpiece returns to the big screen fully restored in 4K.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Censored for more than half a century, Ken Russell&#8217;s visionary masterpiece returns to the big screen fully restored in 4K and cut to Russell&#8217;s direction&#8239;&#8212;&#8201;the first publicly released version of the film as intended by the filmmaker.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Unveiled at the 79th Cannes Film Festival, the definitive version arrives 55 years after the film&#8217;s original release. Starring Oliver Reed and Vanessa Redgrave, </span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Ken Russell&#8217;s The Devils</span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;remains a landmark exploration of religious persecution, hysteria and institutional corruption.</span></p>
</div>
  </div>
  <div class="sevencol last timesandsynopsis">
    <h3 class="blockheading blockheading--small blockheading--light blockheading--arrow text--left">
    Buy Tickets
    </h3>
    <div class="filmtimes"><table cellpadding="0"><tr valign="top"><td><table cellpadding="0"><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Friday 30 Oct 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">7:00pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945481.TcsSection_528">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Saturday 31 Oct 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">8:15pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945483.TcsSection_851">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Sunday 1 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">6:00pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945485.TcsSection_4078727">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Monday 2 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">8:30pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945487.TcsSection_4078727">Book Now</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Thursday 5 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus">6:00pm <a class="Button" href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsPerformance_13945489.TcsSection_4078727">Book Now</a></span></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div>
  </div>
