  </div>
<div class="clearfix"></div>
</div>
<div class="clearfix"></div>
<div class="programme">
  <h2><a href="https://tickets.phoenix.org.uk/PhoenixCinemaLeicester.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_437.TcsWebTab_438.TcsProgramme_13947937">After Eight - The Story of Satpal Ram + Q&amp;A</a> (18)</h2>
  <div class="fivecol">
    <div class="image">
      <img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/PHL/14053883.jpg"/>
    </div>
	<div class="synopsis"><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Presented in partnership with De Montfort University's Stephen Lawrence Research Centre, Mos Hannan's documentary delves into the injustices around the trial of Satpal Ram who was assaulted in 1986 in a racially motivated attack.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Despite Britain&#8217;s curry houses serving the nation&#8217;s favourite cuisine, they have often served as backdrops for racism and violence. In 1986 Satpal Ram was assaulted in a racially motivated attack at an Indian restaurant. Stabbed in the face with a glass bottle, he defended himself, sparking a chain of events that would shape his life.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Presented in partnership with De Montfort University's Stephen Lawrence Research Centre, </span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">After Eight</span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;delves into the injustices of his trial, exposing biases and systemic shortcomings that led to a murder conviction despite clear evidence of self-defence. Through interviews, archival footage, and personal accounts, the documentary chronicles a decades-long global campaign for Satpal Ram&#8217;s freedom.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">The screening will be followed by a panel discussion which will include director Mos Hannan, Steve Chandra Savale from Asian Dub Foundation and writer and campaigner Nikesh Shukla.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Steve Chandra Savale is best known as a founding member of Asian Dub Foundation, formed in 1994 and was a key figure in the Free Satpal Ram campaign by writing and releasing the track, Free Satpal Ram. </span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Nikesh Shukla FRSL is a British author and screenwriter. His writing focuses on race, racism, identity, and immigration. After hearing Asian Dub Foundations track, Nikesh joined the campaign as a young activist.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
</div>
  </div>
